BOSS Scorchion Start
    Events
        Time - Every 2.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (All units of BossScorchionDarkShamans are dead) Equal to True
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Scorchion Engage Reset <gen>
        Custom script:   call DisableTrigger(gg_trg_BOSS_Scorchion_Engage_During_Lines)
        Countdown Timer - Pause BossScorchionDarkShamansRTimer
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionDarkShamansLine = (Random integer number between 1 and 3)
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossScorchionDarkShamansLine Equal to 1
                (All units of BossScorchionDarkShamans are dead) Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = The spirits… never to be… controlled…
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("DarkShaman_0007", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans) named Dark Shaman: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossScorchionDarkShamansLine Equal to 2
                (All units of BossScorchionDarkShamans are dead) Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = The fire… is unbound… It devours… us all… 
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("DarkShaman_0008", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans) named Dark Shaman: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BossScorchionDarkShamansLine Equal to 3
                (All units of BossScorchionDarkShamans are dead) Equal to False
            Then - Actions
                -------- ===================================== --------
                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = ...Scorchion will destroy you!
                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("DarkShaman_0009", udg_ExSoundString)
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from (Random unit from BossScorchionDarkShamans) named Dark Shaman: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                -------- ===================================== --------
            Else - Actions
